<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hwan Yung says it paid off debt.</title>
<headline>Hwan Yung says it paid off debt.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hwan Yung Steel Industry Co said in a statement on Wednesday it paid back 590 million won of debt on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Hwan Yung faced a final payment deadline by the end of Tuesday after it failed to settle the debt on Monday, officials at Chung Chong Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chung Chong is one of Hwan Yung's creditor banks.</p>
<p>Hwan Yung's statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
